WEBVTT

00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:07.119
[ Screaming ]

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:08.555
[ Screams ]

00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:14.561
[ Shouts ]

00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:17.999
Ooh!
[ Whimpers ]

00:00:19.131 --> 00:00:22.743
[ Minionese ]

00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:24.745
Thank you.

00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:26.791
Right. Uh--

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.967
And finally, Kevin!

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.361
[ Crowd Cheering ][ Minionese ]

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:35.408
You are a hero
of the highest order.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:39.412
For your bravery and valor,
I am knighting you.

00:00:40.587 --> 00:00:43.503
From here on out,
you are Sir Kevin.

00:00:44.591 --> 00:00:46.724
Well done.

00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:51.207
[ Cheering ]

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:58.214
[ Man Narrating ]
What a beautiful moment!

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:00.999
Kumbaya!Kumbaya!

00:01:01.042 --> 00:01:06.091
The nation-- nay, the world--
was celebrating Kevin,
Stuart and Bob.

00:01:06.134 --> 00:01:09.399
The last few thousand years
were rough, no question,

00:01:09.442 --> 00:01:13.011
but things were finally
going their way.

00:01:13.054 --> 00:01:17.145
Kevin had never
been more proud.

00:01:17.189 --> 00:01:19.104
But something was missing.

00:01:19.147 --> 00:01:21.933
Ha-ha!
Yes, good show, good show!

00:01:21.976 --> 00:01:24.805
Uh, uh-- [ Gasps ]
My crown is gone!

00:01:24.849 --> 00:01:27.547
- It's gone!
- Blimey!

00:01:27.591 --> 00:01:29.245
She's lost the crown!
Oh, my days!

00:01:32.639 --> 00:01:34.293
[ Laughing ]

00:01:34.337 --> 00:01:37.035
Scarlet?
[ Minionese ]
Scarlet!

00:01:37.078 --> 00:01:38.906
Hey!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.995
[ Minionese ]
Scarlet! Hey!

00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:42.562
They took everything
from me--

00:01:42.606 --> 00:01:45.086
my castle,
my reputation!

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.741
Things look bleak, baby.
I'm not gonna lie!

00:01:47.785 --> 00:01:51.223
But now at least
I have my crow--

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.144
[ Panting ]
Huh?

00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:08.414
Child,
give me that back.

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.852
No, I don't think so!

00:02:11.896 --> 00:02:15.203
You have no idea
who you're messing with.

00:02:15.247 --> 00:02:18.119
I am the greatest
super villain of all time!

00:02:18.163 --> 00:02:21.035
[ Chuckling ]
Oh, were you?

00:02:21.079 --> 00:02:23.473
[ Laughing ]

00:02:23.516 --> 00:02:25.301
B-B-B--
Ah.

00:02:28.478 --> 00:02:32.525
B-B-Buddies.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:35.789 --> 00:02:39.010
[ Giggling ]

00:02:42.274 --> 00:02:43.841
Ah!

00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:51.327
Boss! Boss!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.416
[ Shouting In Minionese ]

00:02:53.459 --> 00:02:58.377
Are you really going to
allow that little penguin
to make off with mycrown?

00:03:00.205 --> 00:03:02.381
Oh, Herb.

00:03:02.425 --> 00:03:04.383
I'm done.

00:03:04.427 --> 00:03:06.298
Hey, hey!

00:03:08.344 --> 00:03:11.216
For me? Aw.

00:03:11.259 --> 00:03:13.392
Sí.

00:03:13.436 --> 00:03:15.176
Bye-bye!

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:18.832
Big boss![ Whooping ]

00:03:18.876 --> 00:03:23.402
[ Narrator ]
And that is how the Minions
found their new boss.

00:03:23.446 --> 00:03:27.014
He was cunning,
he was evil, he was perfect.

00:03:27.058 --> 00:03:30.670
He was... despicable.

00:03:30.714 --> 00:03:32.585
[ Sinister Chuckling ]

00:03:41.072 --> 00:03:42.987
[ Man ]
♪ I was alone, I took a ride

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.730
♪ I didn't know
what I would find there ♪

00:03:48.166 --> 00:03:50.081
♪ Another road where maybe I

00:03:50.124 --> 00:03:53.389
♪ Could see another kind
of mind there ♪[ Babbling ]

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:58.263
♪ Ooh, then I suddenly see you

00:03:58.306 --> 00:04:01.832
♪ Ooh, did I tell you
I need you ♪

00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:06.402
♪ Every single day
of my life? ♪

00:04:09.187 --> 00:04:10.928
♪ You didn't run
You didn't lie ♪

00:04:10.971 --> 00:04:13.757
♪ You knew I wanted
just to hold you ♪

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.324
[ Babbling ]Banana!

00:04:16.368 --> 00:04:18.152
♪ And had you gone,
you knew in time ♪

00:04:18.196 --> 00:04:21.068
♪ We'd meet again
for I had told you ♪

00:04:21.112 --> 00:04:23.114
[ Screaming ]

00:04:23.157 --> 00:04:26.422
♪ Ooh, you were meant
to be near me ♪[ Shouting ]

00:04:26.465 --> 00:04:29.990
♪ Ooh, and I want you
to hear me ♪Aaah! Ah, banana!

00:04:30.034 --> 00:04:34.734
♪ Say we'll be together
every day ♪

00:04:37.302 --> 00:04:39.260
♪ Got to get you into my life

00:04:42.525 --> 00:04:45.310
Hey!
[ Minionese ]

00:04:47.617 --> 00:04:49.575
♪ What can I do?
What can I be? ♪

00:04:49.619 --> 00:04:53.318
♪ When I'm with you,
I want to stay there ♪

00:04:54.798 --> 00:04:56.495
♪ If I'm true,
I'll never leave ♪

00:04:56.539 --> 00:05:01.413
♪ And if I do,
I know the way there ♪

00:05:01.457 --> 00:05:04.938
♪ Ooh, then I suddenly see you

00:05:04.982 --> 00:05:08.681
♪ Ooh, did I tell you
I need you ♪Shh! Shh!

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:12.380
♪ Every single day
of my life? ♪[ Growling ]

00:05:12.424 --> 00:05:14.470
[ Gru Shouting ]

00:05:14.513 --> 00:05:17.864
Cheese! Cheese! Cheese! ♪ Got to get you into my life

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.658
♪ Got to get you into my life

00:05:31.487 --> 00:05:33.445
[ Laughing ]

00:05:33.489 --> 00:05:35.578
♪ Got to get you into my life

